<title>BRAZIL: Brazil 1996 trade balance due at 1430 GMT Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Brazil 1996 trade balance due at 1430 GMT Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian government will announce the 1996 trade balance at 1230 local time/1430 GMT Tuesday, a Ministry of Industry and Commerce spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
